<!-- This file defines how to render Jalali dates and product images. -->

# Dates and images

Format a visible date with `formatJalali` from `src/shared/lib/jalali.ts`. Do not repeat Jalali conversion inside a feature.

Render a product image with `next/image`. Set dimensions or `fill`, and take `alt` from the product name.

```tsx
import Image from "next/image";
import { formatJalali } from "@/shared/lib/jalali";

<Image src={product.image} alt={product.name} width={480} height={480} />
<time dateTime={order.createdAt}>{formatJalali(order.createdAt)}</time>
```
